    {
      "test": 3,
      "prompt": "bulk order 10 hoodies",
      "how_adjusted": "The shop has one hoodie SKU: 10 Basic Hoodie Big Yale (CC-HOOD-NAVY). No discount price was requested, so the tool returns the list quote and the price floor.",
